{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "a76e9ac7a3c6e100302126c99cca7cdcd0bf6d8d6c93f168fc2004a1a6a46f45", "ja": "トゥインクル☆企画書", "zh": "闪亮☆企划书", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f770aff72e16ca80c4f3b70fc15b3f7e0a20ef51cbf4888005cfc6b3e1851893", "ja": "3人に手渡された新番組の企画書。\n育は憧れの魔法少女像とのギャップに\n戸惑い、百合子と亜利沙は殺陣の練習を\n恐れる。しかし育の言葉に触発され、\n全員、頑張ることを決意する。", "zh": "三人拿到了新节目的企划书。\n育因为与自己憧憬的魔法少女有所落差\n而感到困惑，百合子与亚利沙则是害怕\n武打桥段的练习。但是在育的激励之下，\n大家决定努力加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca8830a30d67055a16c83cecd627db7e1e4b6aa0f2e1ae2e78fd146a4db41283", "ja": "というわけで……\n育、百合子、亜利沙！", "zh": "事情就是这样……\n育、百合子、亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "759b48044aa91c6edb602e10333721b9d05fb78ca60d353ad0b7aa7c01fc37db", "ja": "この3人に、新番組『魔法少女トゥインクルリズム』に\n出演してもらおうと思う！", "zh": "要请你们三个演出\n新节目『魔法少女闪亮节奏』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "b11550e78a6382bdb0489d619ddba809237d4b10b36c6f4b6ce45d1bccd16f3a", "ja": "やった～！（やりました～！）", "zh": "太好了～！（太好啦～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "7ff3310e74feaa5a8005730941d37d05ab154ada5a52e16e247e6b98488454ce", "ja": "やりました～！", "zh": "太好啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "81721ba96cc55407379cc4fd02cc98d0fe63f21004dac072ecd906c6049da274", "ja": "わたし、そういうお仕事すっごくやってみたかったの！\n{$P$}さん、大好き！", "zh": "我一直好想试试看这种工作！\n{$P$}先生，我最喜欢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aa25bc5d49b4900da1e09ff9581b443fd760c24fe6ef22ab3218d7aac71b166f", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\n俺も、育にピッタリの仕事だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n我也觉得这工作很适合育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "bad37896fdf90a34f3feaf4feaf2ec7812d3b3a4a38104cb56d1dd3e087c5374", "ja": "よかったね、育ちゃん！　でも、私もまさか\n本当に変身できる日が来るとは思いませんでした！", "zh": "太好了，小育！不过，\n我也没想到有一天真的可以变身呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c28632f1f54d0db7b1d500384a8bdc1fb0f07f5925f84345da9a0ff680cc1b68", "ja": "ああ、本当に変身できそうに思える熱演、\n期待してるぞ！", "zh": "是啊，期待你们发挥演技，\n让人以为你们真的能变身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "10c9e04c3cf2feb5691f4a4b35a569cef1897a7b022941accc9f65c839139058", "ja": "キラキラした魔法少女のコスチュームに身を包む、\n育ちゃんと百合子ちゃん……。", "zh": "身穿闪亮魔法少女服装的\n小育和百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "573d2282adfbfce34179484b66f15d9151cab3ac86f8b96fddf534ae7b933bee", "ja": "はぁ～～～！　想像しただけでありさ、\nごはん3杯はいけちゃいますよぉ！", "zh": "啊～～～！亚利沙光是用想像的，\n就配得下三碗饭啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "41f47436bdfcba62d5235129bf7038fba4875aac153f6d235414fde3018f7415", "ja": "よし。その調子でたくさん食べて、\n撮影もしっかり頑張ってくれよ！", "zh": "很好。就是这样，多吃点，\n录影时努力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bb0b3f8135e8dd83c402e9a2182dab061dc8c9095218e32d175c9fdc327943da", "ja": "そして、ついさっき設定資料と台本が届いたんだ。\n早速みんなで読んでみよう！", "zh": "还有，我刚刚拿到设定资料和剧本了。\n大家赶紧来看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "5b3f83c8e8cbc5c25a099ac91a5766eb5c1386d05dc1276158d807989f7d4d7c", "ja": "わぁ……わぁ～っ♪", "zh": "哇……哇啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "b4ce421a813e2cd3fc989ea1d96ed7c1b9af695fc49acf86ccf1495490985ff3", "ja": "変身アイテムがコンパクトなんだって！\n『シャイ二ー☆アイドル』みたい！", "zh": "上面说变身道具是蜜粉盒耶！\n跟『闪耀☆偶像』一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "64b42f76a5203157a559d6b424a4c3f3621f187b0c88da73c624f496d62ba522", "ja": "ああ、育が好きな魔法少女アニメだっけ。\nやっぱり魔法少女といえば、コンパクトなのかもな！", "zh": "对耶，那是育很喜欢的魔法少女动画吧？\n看来魔法少女就是要用蜜粉盒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "83105c897b7a2d9c838a3a6feb9621ae57272f7cabbf15e5f12b38d946ad126e", "ja": "これは……ふむふむ。\n……えっ？　このイメージの絵……！", "zh": "这是……嗯嗯。\n……咦？这个示意图……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "64df63573b698fa8b30f83d18fa0581f8e661607cb53103d1d84f48e9a070f1d", "ja": "魔法少女が使う武器は、ダガー、鎌、鞭……。\nそれに、この衣装！　ゴシック調で……素敵ですっ！", "zh": "魔法少女用的武器是匕首、镰刀、鞭子……\n还有，她们的服装！是歌德风的……太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "05488b2ff5a073fe7963d3c20d8e98e8d61e0f36672240567e3c9a15cf3158a7", "ja": "えっ……！？", "zh": "咦……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "1ce1e1e2580dc72a1b403f01408720631499ea55de761bd85de50e9fdee1036a", "ja": "みなさん、この台本も見てください！\nこれは、なかなか燃え上がる展開ですよ！", "zh": "大家也看看剧本！\n剧情发展相当热血喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cf779213c15d201404b11acbd61b76565896f48a84affa6f627d3ec9261bb90e", "ja": "おっ、いいじゃないか。どんなお話なんだ？", "zh": "喔，听起来不错嘛。是怎样的故事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "33a43b58fe7260361edac87810f9a02c0621a85a3de2fbfea33f50c36ffec43d", "ja": "魔法少女は『悪のギョーカイジン』と戦うんです！\nこの敵が、相当な悪者なんです！", "zh": "魔法少女要和『邪恶的业界怪人』战斗！\n这些敌人坏透了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "e0bf9b7fe311c4f6010d60415e3f98c971883607617c6a461d68a4b06ece272b", "ja": "ギョーカイジンは人々をだまして、夢を奪う悪者\nなんですよ！　む、ムフゥーっ！！　ムフゥゥゥ！！！", "zh": "业界怪人是欺骗人们、夺走他们梦想的坏蛋！\n唔、唔呼～！！唔呼～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "d223b96652850e77973053f0595958c775baac9273a1b6d8b31fc2fec715e4a3", "ja": "一人のアイドルちゃんファンとして、夢を奪う悪を\n許すわけにはいきませんっ！　ムフゥゥゥーっ！！", "zh": "身为一个偶像宝贝的粉丝，\n绝对不能饶恕夺走梦想的坏蛋！唔呼～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ab27ee1fcea8320f167eec31fbd21a659198f1f9aa020b508257629b117525bf", "ja": "お、落ち着こう、亜利沙。今すぐ悪を成敗しそうだが、\nまだ役に入り込むのは早いぞ！", "zh": "冷、冷静点，亚利沙。你一副现在就要惩奸除恶的样子，\n不用这么快就入戏啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "c5c6ebe140718e4acab6439c7c9896d42d680d2d6c7b1f45f8ef37ac379531e3", "ja": "う～……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4b43cdb2ddf081307c617407b31b5440eb6aaf29e96acc84c655d1c6af8475b7", "ja": "……育？\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "……育？\n你怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "6ec62af281997c8af622aedd71933b5224d8574ddec84ca21ea08865acd02c13", "ja": "なんかおもってたのとちがう……。魔法少女って\nステッキとかでキラリン☆って戦うのに……。", "zh": "这好像跟我想像中的不太一样……\n魔法少女应该要拿魔法棒闪亮亮☆地战斗啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "433a44209159d301a59e900c238c814e05fc07d23cf5e3df8f24afdc8e283910", "ja": "うーん……。\n育のイメージと、ちょっと違ったか。", "zh": "唔……\n这和育想像的不太一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "9709ef1e7b34585d0c368b343ebdc37607f87b047a15f720da3b580385502990", "ja": "でも育ちゃん、ゴシック系の魔法少女なんて\nとっても素敵だと思うよっ。武器もかっこいいし！", "zh": "可是小育，\n我觉得歌德风的魔法少女也很棒喔！武器也很帅气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "0572fd57436e35b7729f9ea539f01132c451f09b72335bd7133bb5dd366ebad8", "ja": "ああ、みんなが武器を持って戦う姿は\nきっとすごく……。", "zh": "对啊，大家拿着武器战斗的英姿，\n肯定非常……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "65ac9510316de2eeb8c2499bcddd5fa94ea6904a73f3033b1bf71ed5a7406678", "ja": "（ん？　育や百合子、亜利沙がこの武器を……\n振り回して戦うってことか？）", "zh": "（嗯？育、百合子跟亚利沙要拿这些武器……\n挥舞它们战斗吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "12d4c7e94d16bfa3d44df7c1cf92df486ab8670ddda60149744c0fbc17a4487c", "ja": "？　どうしたんですか、\n{$P$}さん……あっ！", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗？\n{$P$}先生……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "d7ba4d8281acc548522301df721cdb9e42ce4c5c834d9c39c0d05d59f7ac54de", "ja": "こ、こういう武器を使うなら、戦闘アクション……\n殺陣っていうのとか、練習しなきゃいけませんよね！？", "zh": "如、如果要用这种武器的话，就需要战斗动作……\n也就是要练习武打动作了，对不对！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2bb1b4475b385224168f01bb698a952fa6f101aa8fdf2a0e3ece63e7700a5cc1", "ja": "そ、そうだな。資料によると、育がダガー、\n百合子が鎌、亜利沙が鞭を持って戦うらしい。", "zh": "是、是啊。我看资料上面写的，育拿的是匕首，\n百合子拿镰刀，亚利沙则是拿鞭子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "bfe4dd380f04c8d0afd497be40e1b70d9de5c508522cd40199a80fbe3a747538", "ja": "そのようですね……むむむ。\nこれは、たくさん練習しなくちゃダメそうです……。", "zh": "好像是呢……唔唔唔。\n看来需要很多练习呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "5d4c90a63b03c7b45c2e441406f496a35715ad981186eb520cae16a5f6b2b66b", "ja": "（思った以上にハードな撮影になりそうだ。\n育はまだ小さいし、ここはキャスティングを……）", "zh": "（看来拍摄过程会比想像中来得困难。\n而且育年纪还小，我看还是换角吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "31e5705b029a21977198c1ab80258b7c8433b45b0fe3e6232ff0ed84d006abd4", "ja": "わ、わたし、できるよ！　やってみる！", "zh": "我、我办得到！让我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "3e2e26a756e27fcda536977367cf283ea3c098923b02ca4f41ecbaecff818d5c", "ja": "育ちゃん……！", "zh": "小育……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "8441536cdc4439d3326eb3d4200c554c75f83bf015454bc446b270a32f1fe3c8", "ja": "思ってたのと違うけど……。でも、お仕事だもん。\nわたし、ちゃんとできるよ！", "zh": "虽然跟我想像的不一样……不过，这是工作啊。\n我会努力做好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "2c98a5d5d55a48ac738ba99a2df44d9096e0eaac426fe05ed383ff3ed4a527df", "ja": "子どもだからできないとか、そういうのだいっきらい！\nがんばったら、ぜったいできるようになるもんっ！", "zh": "我最讨厌别人看我还是小孩就说我办不到！\n只要我好好努力，一定可以的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "2a6c2f12105b4d3c4535fff2736e894c2e5196fd969e696892eeec94a8bf1281", "ja": "育……！　そうだな、その意気だ！", "zh": "育……！没错，这么积极就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "0c720d6720af184927ba40b45d3d0a8e34258fc0c381526d1bbbd8e77d66e041", "ja": "ムフフ……決意の育ちゃんもかわい……じゃなくって！\nありさも年上として負けてられないです！", "zh": "唔呼呼……下定决心的小育也好可爱……不对！\n亚利沙比较年长，也不能输给小育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "06a1ef9058180536e947a968f50c4a4d2ce34479fc999cdd10bdab2866b0efc9", "ja": "私も、ちょっと自信ないですけど、こんなに素敵な\n衣装で戦えるなら、へこたれてなんかいられません！", "zh": "我也是，虽然我没什么信心，但如果能穿\n这么漂亮的服装战斗，我绝对不会退缩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "043be33c39ba241a249a6f1b1d75d89d255223a48484a9d5cd8d7bd7a24603f2", "ja": "よし！　ちょっと厳しい撮影になるかもしれないが、\nみんな、明日からレッスンがんばっていこうな！", "zh": "很好！虽说拍摄过程可能会有点辛苦，\n大家从明天起开始努力进行训练课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
