{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "75efb540db5528d9788586016ea49ff0eaf029728da1e674d31ce02a7f3cc5ca", "ja": "（思った以上に難しそうな企画だ。社長が言ってた\n『尖ってる』って、こういうことか……）", "zh": "（这企划比想像中来得困难。\n社长说的『独特』就是这个意思吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "8232a2d89e93381b6a72df92814ba8d72225d69fe0e72443bea335afaeba6880", "ja": "（けど、育の負けん気が二人を引っ張ってくれた。\n俺も、育に負けてる場合じゃないぞ！）", "zh": "（不过，育不服输的个性牵引了其他两人。\n我也不能输给她呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
